{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18102290","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18102290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:0:1810229001:0":{"text":"Then, you wait patiently.","source_cn":"你耐心地等待着","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7BD305337F38916E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then, you wait patiently.","female":"Then, you wait patiently.","variant_male_record_index":"241662","variant_female_record_index":"241663","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1810229002:0":{"text":"Hours later, the last audition finally wraps up.","source_cn":"又过了大半天，所有人的试戏都终于完成","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA57710C42BC402A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1810229003:0":{"text":"To your amazement, you don't feel tired at all.","source_cn":"奇妙的是，你居然一点也没有感到困倦","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4474C52DE6A37B82","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"To your amazement, you don't feel tired at all.","female":"To your amazement, you don't feel tired at all.","variant_male_record_index":"241665","variant_female_record_index":"241666","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810229004:0":{"text":"Thank you all for your wonderful performances! Some of you even gave me a few interesting ideas that could make the scene even better. I truly appreciate it.","source_cn":"呵呵呵，各位对这场戏的演绎都很精彩！有几位还给我带来了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0015FE5514C06E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810229005:0":{"text":"After careful consideration, Senea and I have made our decision.","source_cn":"经过讨论，我和塞涅已经选出了最合适的演员。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3095F202D79B101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810229006:0":{"text":"Senea, do you mind making the announcement? I'm sure they'd much rather hear the result from you.","source_cn":"塞涅，请你来公布吧。大家肯定不期待从我嘴里听到他们的名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF260F3AECBC8E289","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810229007:0":{"text":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4279679B7284A45","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"241670","variant_female_record_index":"241671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1810229007":{"text":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style><male>先生</male><female>小姐</female>。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4279679B7284A45","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"It's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"241670","variant_female_record_index":"241671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810229008:1":{"text":"That's right.","source_cn":"是的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEF466937B9FF5114","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's right.","female":"That's right.","variant_male_record_index":"241672","variant_female_record_index":"241673","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810229011:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, you're amazing!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCE128D93AA5E8A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, you're amazing!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, you're amazing!","variant_male_record_index":"241678","variant_female_record_index":"241679","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810229012:0":{"text":"I'm so disappointed... I was already picturing myself onstage with Senea...","source_cn":"好遗憾……原本还幻想着要是我能被塞涅选中呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8192885D2C765DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810229013:0":{"text":"I love the revised script! Senea, please get plenty of rest before the show!","source_cn":"我很喜欢改后的剧本，期待正式演出的那天！塞涅，在那之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EB1A09AAD6E707E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810229014:1":{"text":"Thanks. I won't fall ill anymore.","source_cn":"谢谢。现在的我已经不会再生病了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A33BED3ADE63A57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810229015:0":{"text":"Now, let's clear the backstage and give our newest actor some room to rehearse! The show's just days away.","source_cn":"好了好了，距离正式演出没几天了，还是把后台交给我们这位...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD1AA17B1FB10908D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Now, let's clear the backstage and give our newest actor some room to rehearse! The show's just days away.","female":"Now, let's clear the backstage and give our newest actress some room to rehearse! The show's just days away.","variant_male_record_index":"241685","variant_female_record_index":"241686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810229016:0":{"text":"As for the rest of you, don't be too upset! Senea has prepared a special little gift for each of you.","source_cn":"遗憾落选的观众不用灰心，塞涅也给你们准备了一份独特的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D14316C859754A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"... Me?","source_cn":"……我？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE19A39DC00AE068E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... Me?","female":"... Me?","variant_male_record_index":"92289","variant_female_record_index":"92290","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810229009:0":{"tex